    {
      "id": "claim_987399b25a5c413cbde2118a8749b2e6",
      "statement": "packages/server/src/index.ts is the single server entrypoint: main() wires boot in a fixed order (initializeDatabase → LoopService.recoverInterruptedRuns → profile-gated bootstrap → AuthService/bootstrapAdmin → middleware chain → WebSocketService → RuntimeGovernanceService + ExecutionEngine task recovery → learning services → schedulers → /api router → /explore public routes → dashboard static serving → errorHandler → listen → SIGTERM handler), and any uncaught failure from main() exits the process with code 1.",
