    {
      "id": "claim_eda78a0e867f4349b7cb7140c2112be6",
      "statement": "initializeDatabase() applies a staged backup restore (restore-pending.json marker atomically renames a staged DB over the target and records a restore_completed audit event), opens better-sqlite3 at DB_PATH/DJIMITFLO_DB (default <monorepo>/.data/djimitflo.sqlite), sets foreign_keys=ON and journal_mode=WAL, then runs pre-schema migrations, both schemas, post-schema migrations, and ensureDatabaseInstanceId before any service is constructed.",
