    {
      "id": "claim_366286a5d3b747d6a4f0ab8a8931cfbf",
      "statement": "At boot the in-memory lease registry (RuntimeLeaseRegistry) is empty, so recoverInterruptedRuns marks every DB-'running' worker lease 'failed' with reason server_restart and every active loop run without a live lease 'interrupted' with reason server_restart; runs in 'planning' and runs whose goal is blocked awaiting a human approval are deliberately left alone, and orphaned worktrees older than the grace period are pruned in the same call. The operation is idempotent and never dispatches work.",
