      "id": "claim_8746e78040074b78bc63ade6eb7bfc65",
      "statement": "The Express middleware chain is security-order-sensitive: trust proxy=1 (required for express-rate-limit behind one nginx hop), securityHeaders, cors, then the GitHub webhook router at /github/webhook mounted BEFORE express.json() because its HMAC signature check needs the exact raw wire bytes (express.raw), then express.json() and requestLogger; the public /health endpoint reports build identity including commit_matches_build.",
