      "statement": "The WebSocket server is created on the shared HTTP server at path /ws with handleProtocols echoing the client's 'bearer.<token>' subprotocol per RFC 6455 §4.2.2, and WebSocketService authenticates every connection by verifying the JWT via AuthService, rejecting unauthenticated/expired/inactive-user connections with WS_CLOSE_CODES.AUTH_* close codes.",
