      "id": "claim_f21ccb1b9d704a9abc06ab9d9e2fccd2",
      "statement": "In operator-capable profiles the TelegramGatewayService is dynamically imported from @djimitflo/telegram and startAll()ed only when TELEGRAM_BOTS_CONFIG is set, and the instance is retained so SIGTERM can call stopAll() to release bot file leases — otherwise a restart sees EEXIST and skips polling forever; in-memory default-off schedulers (compliance reports, self-healing, self-improvement auto-review, frontier experts, specialist-panel backlog, memory candidate review) are armed via start() methods that no-op unless their enable env var is set.",
