      "id": "claim_36ef57a08eef48b7a8d77216284a9ddb",
      "statement": "Before main() runs, module-level code derives a default DJIMITFLO_CONTROL_URL of http://<dialHost>:<PORT>/api/swarms/spawns (rewriting the 0.0.0.0/localhost bind address to loopback 127.0.0.1 because a bind address is not a dial address) so same-host runtime children can call back to the nested-spawn endpoint without operator configuration, and logs the anti-agentic ransomware module mode (RANSOMWARE_MODULE_ENABLED default on, RANSOMWARE_MODULE_MODE default 'detect').",
