      "statement": "The production dashboard is served from DASHBOARD_PATH (default packages/dashboard/dist) via express.static plus an SPA fallback answering index.html only for GET requests with Accept: text/html that are not under /api, /ws, or /health; DASHBOARD_SERVE_ENABLED=false or a missing dist directory puts the server into API-only mode. The errorHandler is registered last and maps error codes to HTTP statuses via pattern inference.",
